<title>THAILAND: Thai dealers asked not to buy dlrs from offshore.</title>
<headline>Thai dealers asked not to buy dlrs from offshore.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand on Friday had asked local banks not to buy dollars from offshore parties in another attempt to fend off speculation against the baht, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;We were informally informed (by the central bank) not to buy dollars from offshore players. Most other banks were also unquoted (with offshore parties) today,&quot; said one dealer at a European bank.</p>
<p>The dealer said offshore players want baht to unwind their large long dollar positions.</p>
</text>
